
---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>👋 Hey, I'm Manish!</h1>

			<p>
				Welcome to my little corner of the internet. I'm glad you're here!
				This is my personal space where I share my thoughts, experiences,
				projects, and the things I find interesting along the way.
			</p>

			<p>
				I'm someone who enjoys learning, exploring new ideas, and turning
				curiosity into something meaningful. Whether it's working on a new
				project, discovering something new, or simply sharing what's on my
				mind, this website is where it all comes together.
			</p>

			<p>
				You'll find a little bit of everything here:
			</p>

			<ul>
				<li>Things I'm working on and projects I've built</li>
				<li>Thoughts, ideas, and personal experiences</li>
				<li>Things I've learned and want to share</li>
				<li>Interests, hobbies, and things that inspire me</li>
				<li>Occasional notes about life and everything in between</li>
			</ul>

			<p>
				This website is always evolving, just like me. Think of it as
				an open notebook — a place to document my journey, experiment
				with ideas, and share whatever feels worth putting out into
				the world.
			</p>

			<p>
				Feel free to explore, read a few posts, and get to know me
				along the way. Thanks for stopping by!
			</p>

			<p>
				<strong>Make yourself at home. 😊</strong>
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
